GLPI on FenrirOS
================

Code in /usr/share/glpi (web root: public/); configuration in /etc/glpi, data
in /var/lib/glpi, logs in /var/log/glpi (inc/downstream.php). PHP runs as _php.

1. Create a MariaDB database and user for GLPI.
2. Install from the command line:
     su -s /bin/sh _php -c 'php /usr/share/glpi/bin/console db:install \
         --db-host=localhost --db-name=glpi --db-user=glpi --db-password=...'
   or open the web installer after step 3.
3. nginx: /usr/share/doc/glpi/nginx-glpi.conf; enable php-fpm and nginx.
4. Automatic actions: install the example cron job, enable crond, and set
   them to "CLI" mode in GLPI's settings:
     cp /usr/share/doc/glpi/glpi.cron /etc/cron.d/glpi
     dinitctl enable crond
